    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In $\\triangle ABC$, $AB = 8$ cm, $BC = 10$ cm and $\\angle ABC = 60^\\circ$. Find the length of $AC$.",
    "question_zh": "在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = 8$ cm，$BC = 10$ cm 且 $\\angle ABC = 60^\\circ$。求 $AC$ 的長度。",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\sqrt{84}$ cm",
      "B. $\\sqrt{164}$ cm",
      "C. 9 cm",
      "D. 10 cm"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Apply the Cosine Rule: $AC^2 = AB^2 + BC^2 - 2(AB)(BC)\\cos B$.",
      " $AC^2 = 8^2 + 10^2 - 2(8)(10)\\cos 60^\\circ$.",
      " $AC^2 = 64 + 100 - 160(0.5) = 164 - 80 = 84$.",
      " $AC = \\sqrt{84} \\approx 9.17$ cm."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "應用餘弦定理：$AC^2 = AB^2 + BC^2 - 2(AB)(BC)\\cos B$。",
      " $AC^2 = 8^2 + 10^2 - 2(8)(10)\\cos 60^\\circ$。",
      " $AC^2 = 64 + 100 - 80 = 84$。",
      " $AC = \\sqrt{84}$ cm。"
    ],
