    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A set of data has a mean $\\mu$ and standard deviation $\\sigma$. If a constant $k$ (where $k > 0$) is added to each datum in the set, find the new mean and new standard deviation.",
    "question_zh": "一組數據的平均數為 $\\mu$，標準差為 $\\sigma$。若將該組數據中的每個項都加上一個常數 $k$ ($k > 0$)，求新的平均數及新的標準差。",
    "options": [
      "A. New Mean $= \\mu + k$, New SD $= \\sigma + k$",
      "B. New Mean $= \\mu$, New SD $= \\sigma$",
      "C. New Mean $= \\mu + k$, New SD $= \\sigma$",
      "D. New Mean $= \\mu$, New SD $= \\sigma + k$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Adding a constant $k$ shifts all data points equally.",
      "The average position shifts: New Mean $= \\mu + k$.",
      "The spread of data remains identical: New Standard Deviation $= \\sigma$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "每個數據項加上 $k$ 會使所有數據點同向移動。",
      "平均位置移動：新平均數 $= \\mu + k$。",
      "數據的離散程度不變：新標準差 $= \\sigma$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["statistics", "data-transformation"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_316",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Let $f(x) = (x-1)(x^2 + 3x + k)$. If the equation $f(x) = 0$ has only one real root, which of the following must be true?",
    "question_zh": "設 $f(x) = (x-1)(x^2 + 3x + k)$。若方程 $f(x) = 0$ 只有一個實根，下列哪項必為正確？",
    "options": [
      "A. $k < 2.25$",
      "B. $k = 2.25$",
      "C. $k > 2.25$",
      "D. $k = -4$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "The root of $(x-1)$ is $x=1$, which is a real root.",
      "For $f(x)=0$ to have only one real root, the quadratic part $(x^2 + 3x + k) = 0$ must have no real roots.",
      "The discriminant $\\Delta$ must be less than zero: $3^2 - 4(1)(k) < 0$.",
      " $9 - 4k < 0 \\Rightarrow 4k > 9 \\Rightarrow k > 2.25$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "$(x-1)$ 的根為 $x=1$，這是一個實根。",
      "若方程只有一個實根，則二次項 $(x^2 + 3x + k) = 0$ 必須無實根。",
      "判別式 $\\Delta < 0$：$3^2 - 4(1)(k) < 0$。",
      " $9 - 4k < 0 \\Rightarrow k > 2.25$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["polynomials", "roots-of-equations"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_317",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
