    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Consider the region $R$ bounded by the following constraints:\n$x + y \\le 8$\n$x \\ge 2$\n$y \\ge 1$\n(a) Find the coordinates of all vertices of region $R$. (6 marks)\n(b) Minimize $C = 2x + 5y$ over the region $R$. (5 marks)",
    "question_zh": "考慮由以下限制條件圍成的區域 $R$：\n$x + y \\le 8$\n$x \\ge 2$\n$y \\ge 1$\n(a) 求區域 $R$ 所有頂點的坐標。(6分)\n(b) 在區域 $R$ 中心化 (Minimize) $C = 2x + 5y$。(5分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Intersection of $x=2$ and $y=1$: $(2, 1)$.",
      " Intersection of $x+y=8$ and $y=1$: $x+1=8 \\Rightarrow x=7$. Point: $(7, 1)$.",
      " Intersection of $x+y=8$ and $x=2$: $2+y=8 \\Rightarrow y=6$. Point: $(2, 6)$.",
      "(b) Calculate $C$ at each vertex:",
      " $C(2, 1) = 2(2) + 5(1) = 9$.",
      " $C(7, 1) = 2(7) + 5(1) = 19$.",
      " $C(2, 6) = 2(2) + 5(6) = 34$.",
      " The minimum value is 9 at $(2, 1)$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $x=2$ 與 $y=1$ 的交點：$(2, 1)$。",
      " $x+y=8$ 與 $y=1$ 的交點：$x=7$。點：$(7, 1)$。",
      " $x+y=8$ 與 $x=2$ 的交點：$y=6$。點：$(2, 6)$。",
      "(b) 計算各頂點的 $C$ 值：",
      " $C(2, 1) = 9$。",
      " $C(7, 1) = 19$。",
      " $C(2, 6) = 34$。",
      " 最小值為 9，於 $(2, 1)$。"
    ],
