  {
    "id": "ct_sa_318",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_coordinate_geo"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A circle $C$ has the equation $(x - 3)^2 + (y - 4)^2 = 25$. Point $P(6, 8)$ lies on the circle.\n(a) Show that $P$ lies on the circle. (2 marks)\n(b) Find the equation of the tangent back to the circle at point $P$. (10 marks)",
    "question_zh": "圓 $C$ 的方程為 $(x - 3)^2 + (y - 4)^2 = 25$。點 $P(6, 8)$ 位於圓上。\n(a) 證明 $P$ 位於圓上。(2分)\n(b) 求圓於點 $P$ 的切線方程。(10分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Substitute $(6, 8)$ into the equation: $(6-3)^2 + (8-4)^2 = 3^2 + 4^2 = 9 + 16 = 25$. LHS = RHS.",
      "(b) Center of circle $O = (3, 4)$.",
      " Slope of radius $OP = \\frac{8 - 4}{6 - 3} = \\frac{4}{3}$.",
      " Since the tangent is perpendicular to the radius, slope of tangent $m = -\\frac{3}{4}$.",
      " Equation of tangent: $y - 8 = -\\frac{3}{4}(x - 6)$.",
      " $4y - 32 = -3x + 18 \\Rightarrow 3x + 4y - 50 = 0$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 代入 $(6, 8)$：$(6-3)^2 + (8-4)^2 = 9 + 16 = 25$。左端 = 右端。",
      "(b) 圓心 $O = (3, 4)$。",
      " 半徑 $OP$ 的斜率 $= \\frac{8 - 4}{6 - 3} = 4/3$。",
      " 由於切線垂直於半徑，切線斜率 $m = -3/4$。",
      " 切線方程：$y - 8 = -3/4(x - 6)$。",
      " $4y - 32 = -3x + 18 \\Rightarrow 3x + 4y - 50 = 0$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": {
