    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_319",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 10,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A committee of 5 members is to be formed from 6 boys and 4 girls. Find the number of ways to form the committee if it must contain at least 3 girls.",
    "question_zh": "現從 6 名男生及 4 名女生中選出 5 人組成委員會。若委員會必須包含至少 3 名女生，求組成委員會的可能方法數目。",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Case 1: 3 girls and 2 boys.",
      " Ways $= C_3^4 \\times C_2^6 = 4 \\times 15 = 60$.",
      "Case 2: 4 girls and 1 boy.",
      " Ways $= C_4^4 \\times C_1^6 = 1 \\times 6 = 6$.",
      "Total Ways $= 60 + 6 = 66$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "情況 1：3 女生及 2 男生。",
      " 方法數 $= C_3^4 \\times C_2^6 = 4 \\times 15 = 60$。",
      "情況 2：4 女生及 1 男生。",
      " 方法數 $= C_4^4 \\times C_1^6 = 1 \\times 6 = 6$。",
      "總方法數 $= 60 + 6 = 66$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["combinations", "probability"],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_320",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_mensuration"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 8,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A sphere $S$ has a radius $r$. A right circular cylinder $T$ has a base radius $r$ and a height $2r$ (such that the sphere just fits inside the cylinder).\n(a) Express the total surface area of cylinder $T$ in terms of $r$ and $\\pi$. (4 marks)\n(b) Find the ratio of the total surface area of the sphere to the total surface area of the cylinder. (8 marks)",
    "question_zh": "球體 $S$ 的半徑為 $r$。圓柱體 $T$ 的底半徑為 $r$，高為 $2r$（即球體恰好放入圓柱體內）。\n(a) 以 $r$ 及 $\\pi$ 表示圓柱體 $T$ 的總表面積。(4分)\n(b) 求球體的總表面積對圓柱體的總表面積之比。(8分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Curved surface area of cylinder $= 2\\pi r h = 2\\pi r (2r) = 4\\pi r^2$.",
      " Area of two bases $= 2 \\pi r^2$.",
      " Total Surface Area of $T = 4\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi r^2 = 6\\pi r^2$.",
      "(b) Total Surface Area of sphere $S = 4\\pi r^2$.",
      " Ratio $= 4\\pi r^2 : 6\\pi r^2 = 4 : 6 = 2 : 3$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 圓柱體的曲面面積 $= 2\\pi r (2r) = 4\\pi r^2$。",
      " 兩個底面的面積 $= 2\\pi r^2$。",
      " 總表面積 $= 6\\pi r^2$。",
      "(b) 球體總表面積 $= 4\\pi r^2$。",
      " 面積比 $= 4 : 6 = 2 : 3$。"
    ],
    "diagram_json": null,
    "tags": ["mensuration", "combined-solids"],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
